<mjml lang="nb" dir="ltr">
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>Den første døren er nå åpen</mj-title>
    <mj-preview>Vi har mottatt frivilligsøknaden din.</mj-preview>
    <mj-include path="./partials/attributes.mjml" />
  </mj-head>
  <mj-body>
    <mj-include path="./partials/header.mjml" />
    <mj-section padding="30px 24px 24px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text padding="0"><h1 style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;font-family:Fraunces,Georgia,Times New Roman,serif;font-size:36px;font-weight:700;line-height:42px;letter-spacing:-1px;color:#26211e;">Den første døren er nå åpen</h1></mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section>
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text>Det gleder oss å se at du er interessert i å bli frivillig hos oss på Samfunnet i Bergen. Vi tar kontakt så fort som mulig.</mj-text>
        <mj-text>We are delighted that you are interested in becoming a volunteer at Samfunnet i Bergen. We will contact you as soon as possible.</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-include path="./partials/footer.mjml" />
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
